✗ Mailkube does not provide read-back of sent messages.

  This is by design: the API does not serve past state. Delivery outcomes are
  pushed as webhook events instead of being polled.

  To observe what happened to a message:
    mailkube webhooks listen --public-url … --secret …     (locally, live)
    https://app.mailkube.com/domain/logs     (history)

  Scheduled sends have not been dispatched yet, so those you can read:
    mailkube scheduled-emails list

  See: mailkube topic webhooks
